WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.360
Memo to Dr. Bright, for any&nbsp;
future project proposals:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:08.800
If it involves something right, you did it wrong.
We know this sounds a little harsh, but somehow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.800
even when you work within research&nbsp;
parameters, chaos still occurs. Like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.280
when you used a mirror to make the Desire Camera&nbsp;
take a picture of itself, then put the resulting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:22.720
picture into the Clockworks on Very Fine.
Both of these actions are technically “right”,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.800
but considering the result burned the eyes out&nbsp;
of Researcher Johnson’s head the second he looked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.600
upon them, we think you should honestly&nbsp;
just step back from testing for a while.

